Discussing effectiveness:
The testing log demonstrate that HIDS provides exceptional deterministic precision and milisecond parsing efficiency against attack vectors though constrained by its rigidity.
It reamins highly vulnerable to signature evasion using basic character obfuscation tech. Therefore, it frequencely generats false positives and triggers alert fatigue during routine administrative operations,
that it must be paired with anomaly-based detection engines to secure an enterprise perimeter.

